      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.45 (up from ₹1.22 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹934.7m (up 4.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹14.3m (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.5% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 37% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 3% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
